= Treaty of Rapallo

The two powers, have renounced all territorial claim, and financial claim against each other and opened friendly diplomatic relation, mutual diplomatic recognition and lastly they both have pledged to increase economic ties to each other.

- @consequence

@consequence
title: What does it mean for Poland?

The populace is threatened for the two territorial powers to its west and east has reconcile.

Piłsudski confidence in the republic has wane in fear of a new partition.
